"""bouchet-jupyter — launch / tear down JupyterLab sessions on Bouchet.

Run `bouchet-jupyter --help` for usage. Config lives at
~/.config/bouchet-jupyter/config.toml; on first run an existing bash-style
config in the same directory is migrated automatically.
"""
